1
00:00:10,984 --> 00:00:20,069
<font color="#06cdf8">jmg subs</font>

2
00:02:31,735 --> 00:02:32,815
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Who is it?</b></font>

3
00:02:35,906 --> 00:02:39,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hi. My name is Quinn.
I was looking for Elise.</b></font>

4
00:02:42,371 --> 00:02:43,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's okay, Warren. Go upstairs.</b></font>

5
00:02:48,627 --> 00:02:49,787
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm Elise.</b></font>

6
00:02:50,629 --> 00:02:53,669
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hi. Gosh, I'm sorry to
bother you like this.</b></font>

7
00:02:54,925 --> 00:02:56,605
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I got your name from Claire Ortisky's mom.</b></font>

8
00:02:58,554 --> 00:03:00,854
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mrs. Ortisky. Emily. Sorry, Emily Ortisky.</b></font>

9
00:03:01,765 --> 00:03:04,095
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, she told me you worked as a psychic</b></font>

10
00:03:04,184 --> 00:03:06,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and that you were really amazing
when she saw you.</b></font>

11
00:03:06,603 --> 00:03:08,693
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I remember Emily.</b></font>

12
00:03:08,772 --> 00:03:11,232
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. She's awesome.
She's like, she's really nice.</b></font>

13
00:03:12,693 --> 00:03:14,653
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And she told me how great you were.</b></font>

14
00:03:15,404 --> 00:03:17,704
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She gave me a phone number for you,
but it wasn't working.</b></font>

15
00:03:17,781 --> 00:03:23,621
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So, you know, I... I'm really sorry
to have just shown up like this.</b></font>

16
00:03:24,121 --> 00:03:25,501
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's okay.</b></font>

17
00:03:26,248 --> 00:03:30,288
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But if you're looking for a reading,
unfortunately, I don't do those anymore.</b></font>

18
00:03:30,335 --> 00:03:33,835
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I have money. I brought like $50.
- No, no, no, no. It's not that, honey.</b></font>

19
00:03:34,631 --> 00:03:38,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I just can't, and I'm pretty busy, so...
- Okay.</b></font>

20
00:03:41,597 --> 00:03:44,307
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where did you come from?</b></font>

21
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:45,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Whealan Park.</b></font>

22
00:03:47,728 --> 00:03:48,898
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's a long way.</b></font>

23
00:03:48,979 --> 00:03:51,740
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, it's no big deal though.
I mean, I'm the one who just showed up.</b></font>

24
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:53,900
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm really sorry that
I've wasted your time.</b></font>

25
00:03:57,529 --> 00:03:59,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Why don't you come in for a minute?</b></font>

26
00:04:01,658 --> 00:04:03,908
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>A good chat is never time wasted, right?</b></font>

27
00:04:10,334 --> 00:04:14,424
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I love the style of your house. It's so cool.
- Thank you. Have a seat.</b></font>

28
00:04:14,505 --> 00:04:15,515
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thanks.</b></font>

29
00:04:26,433 --> 00:04:28,183
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You're a very smart girl, Quinn.</b></font>

30
00:04:28,894 --> 00:04:31,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Depends who you ask.
- No, you are. You read a lot.</b></font>

31
00:04:31,522 --> 00:04:33,692
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You have a lot of books
in that bag of yours.</b></font>

32
00:04:34,525 --> 00:04:37,405
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. Yeah. I love reading.</b></font>

33
00:04:38,904 --> 00:04:41,074
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What made you come all the way here today?</b></font>

34
00:04:45,035 --> 00:04:49,155
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I wanna talk to someone
who's not around anymore.</b></font>

35
00:04:50,749 --> 00:04:51,749
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Who?</b></font>

36
00:04:52,376 --> 00:04:53,416
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>My mom.</b></font>

37
00:04:55,587 --> 00:04:57,457
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She died a year and a half ago.</b></font>

38
00:04:58,882 --> 00:04:59,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She had cancer.</b></font>

39
00:05:00,717 --> 00:05:04,177
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I mean, well, first she had breast cancer
and then she had a Mastectomy,</b></font>

40
00:05:04,221 --> 00:05:09,391
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>but it decided to hang around
and travel to her lungs.</b></font>

41
00:05:09,434 --> 00:05:12,654
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So, I guess you could say
it wanted to be with her</b></font>

42
00:05:12,729 --> 00:05:14,309
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>just as much as everyone else did.</b></font>

43
00:05:15,732 --> 00:05:16,942
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Well, tell me about her.</b></font>

44
00:05:18,694 --> 00:05:19,784
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I mean, she was great.</b></font>

45
00:05:21,405 --> 00:05:24,665
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Like, I mean, she could always hang out
with all of my friends.</b></font>

46
00:05:25,951 --> 00:05:30,411
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>God, she loved old music,
like Vinyl records and stuff,</b></font>

47
00:05:33,083 --> 00:05:35,003
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and she always wanted to talk to me.</b></font>

48
00:05:36,837 --> 00:05:37,917
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Like...</b></font>

49
00:05:45,053 --> 00:05:46,143
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm sorry.</b></font>

50
00:05:48,599 --> 00:05:50,639
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, no. That's okay.</b></font>

51
00:05:54,605 --> 00:05:55,945
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's like...</b></font>

52
00:05:57,816 --> 00:06:00,356
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's like sometimes
I can feel her around me.</b></font>

53
00:06:02,279 --> 00:06:03,739
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Like at night I'll be in my room,</b></font>

54
00:06:03,780 --> 00:06:06,830
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>or I'll be sleeping
and something will wake me up.</b></font>

55
00:06:07,409 --> 00:06:10,369
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Or, you know,
I'll find things in weird places.</b></font>

56
00:06:10,454 --> 00:06:12,624
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Like I'll find my diary somewhere strange.</b></font>

57
00:06:14,917 --> 00:06:16,077
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't know.</b></font>

58
00:06:18,045 --> 00:06:21,515
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I mean, I guess it's kind of crazy.
- Not to me, it isn't.</b></font>

59
00:06:23,634 --> 00:06:28,434
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You've tried to contact your mother
on your own, haven't you?</b></font>

60
00:06:30,307 --> 00:06:33,597
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. Yeah.
Yeah, I mean, I've...</b></font>

61
00:06:34,478 --> 00:06:37,688
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I mean, I've asked her to talk to me
but, you know, she never does.</b></font>

62
00:06:38,815 --> 00:06:39,935
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's why I came here.</b></font>

63
00:06:41,401 --> 00:06:45,451
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You know?
I really need to ask her some questions.</b></font>

64
00:06:49,868 --> 00:06:51,328
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I know what that's like.</b></font>

65
00:07:00,796 --> 00:07:04,626
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>All right. You have to give me a moment,
and I can't promise anything.</b></font>

66
00:07:07,219 --> 00:07:08,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Here, please take a little bit of money.</b></font>

67
00:07:09,012 --> 00:07:12,972
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No. I got out of this business.
If I accept that from you, I'm back in it.</b></font>

68
00:07:15,519 --> 00:07:18,859
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Normally, we do this downstairs
in my reading room.</b></font>

69
00:07:23,694 --> 00:07:24,694
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What's your mom's name?</b></font>

70
00:07:25,988 --> 00:07:29,238
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lily. Lily Brenner.</b></font>

71
00:07:31,827 --> 00:07:32,987
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lily Brenner.</b></font>

72
00:07:47,176 --> 00:07:52,886
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm calling out and trying to make contact
with Lily Brenner.</b></font>

73
00:07:54,224 --> 00:07:58,234
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lily, if you can hear me,
please talk to me.</b></font>

74
00:08:02,649 --> 00:08:03,729
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lily.</b></font>

75
00:08:06,028 --> 00:08:07,318
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you out there?</b></font>

76
00:08:12,868 --> 00:08:14,828
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I can hear someone.
- Is it my mom?</b></font>

77
00:08:20,792 --> 00:08:22,422
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, it isn't your mother.</b></font>

78
00:08:29,426 --> 00:08:31,336
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Go away.</b></font>

79
00:08:33,430 --> 00:08:35,600
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Go away. Go away.</b></font>

80
00:09:01,124 --> 00:09:02,214
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm sorry.</b></font>

81
00:09:03,252 --> 00:09:05,552
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm sorry.
There's a reason I had to stop doing this.</b></font>

82
00:09:07,923 --> 00:09:10,973
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There's other people that do this.
You have to find one of them.</b></font>

83
00:09:12,344 --> 00:09:13,934
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You're gonna be okay, Quinn.</b></font>

84
00:09:15,973 --> 00:09:17,223
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But take my advice</b></font>

85
00:09:18,684 --> 00:09:21,394
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and do not try to contact your mother
on your own anymore.</b></font>

86
00:09:24,815 --> 00:09:27,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You have to be very careful.</b></font>

87
00:09:27,985 --> 00:09:30,535
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>If you call out to one of the dead,</b></font>

88
00:09:33,657 --> 00:09:35,487
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>all of them can hear you.</b></font>

89
00:09:59,892 --> 00:10:01,272
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you there?</b></font>

90
00:10:14,656 --> 00:10:15,736
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mom?</b></font>

91
00:10:44,061 --> 00:10:45,231
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you there?</b></font>

92
00:11:10,921 --> 00:11:15,131
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Today? No. Today? No, I don't think so. No.</b></font>

93
00:11:15,217 --> 00:11:16,257
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hey, you know what?</b></font>

94
00:11:16,343 --> 00:11:19,853
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What I mean is that I can't be
in two places at the same time.</b></font>

95
00:11:20,806 --> 00:11:22,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, the whole building
needs to be rewired.</b></font>

96
00:11:22,850 --> 00:11:24,770
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The original guys really screwed it.</b></font>

97
00:11:26,311 --> 00:11:28,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You know, that's an entire extra day
of work for me.</b></font>

98
00:11:28,438 --> 00:11:29,858
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You got that, right?</b></font>

99
00:11:31,191 --> 00:11:32,231
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hang on, Bill.</b></font>

100
00:11:32,276 --> 00:11:34,186
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There's no food.
Didn't you go to the grocery?</b></font>

101
00:11:34,278 --> 00:11:36,108
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Yeah, I did.
- Well, what did you get?</b></font>

102
00:11:36,196 --> 00:11:39,736
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I mean, what's this, "Quinoa"?
- Quinoa.</b></font>

103
00:11:41,410 --> 00:11:44,950
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Bill? Yeah, of course,
I'm gonna call the guy.</b></font>

104
00:11:44,997 --> 00:11:47,747
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I gotta get the part. Hang on, Bill.</b></font>

105
00:11:49,418 --> 00:11:51,288
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What are you doing?
- I'm taking a photo.</b></font>

106
00:11:51,336 --> 00:11:53,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Why?
- Dad, it's for my blog.</b></font>

107
00:11:54,256 --> 00:11:56,176
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>None of what you just said to me
makes any sense.</b></font>

108
00:11:56,216 --> 00:11:57,336
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's not supposed to.</b></font>

109
00:11:57,426 --> 00:12:00,756
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay. Well, how about don't blog it?
Just eat it.</b></font>

110
00:12:01,471 --> 00:12:02,641
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's a great T-shirt.</b></font>

111
00:12:03,473 --> 00:12:05,773
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You're weird. You're such a weird person.</b></font>

112
00:12:05,809 --> 00:12:08,139
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You know, nobody cares
what you're having for breakfast.</b></font>

113
00:12:08,187 --> 00:12:10,727
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Will you just go get your brother
ready for school, please?</b></font>

114
00:12:14,067 --> 00:12:17,027
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Alex. Alex!
- What?</b></font>

115
00:12:17,279 --> 00:12:20,119
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Come on. Get up. Get ready for school.
- I am.</b></font>

116
00:12:20,991 --> 00:12:23,081
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>God, it stinks in here. Come on, get up.</b></font>

117
00:12:24,328 --> 00:12:26,078
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, fine. I'll tell dad.</b></font>

118
00:12:26,997 --> 00:12:29,167
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Jeez! Can you hold on a second?
I was getting...</b></font>

119
00:12:29,249 --> 00:12:31,749
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Just get out! Get out! Get out!
- Don't touch me!</b></font>

120
00:12:58,695 --> 00:13:00,315
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"I'll never forget this.</b></font>

121
00:13:01,031 --> 00:13:04,031
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"You'll go to the end of the world,
and you'll find me waiting there.</b></font>

122
00:13:04,660 --> 00:13:05,870
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"Your servant.</b></font>

123
00:13:08,539 --> 00:13:10,579
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"You'll always find me waiting there,
your servant."</b></font>

124
00:13:16,547 --> 00:13:18,377
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay. "I'll never forget this."</b></font>

125
00:13:20,843 --> 00:13:23,473
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>All right, all right. I am. I'm hurrying.
Right. Bye.</b></font>

126
00:13:25,055 --> 00:13:27,175
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Why is it quiet? Quiet's not good.</b></font>

127
00:13:29,351 --> 00:13:31,771
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Alex, you see this face?
This is my "whoop-ass" face.</b></font>

128
00:13:31,895 --> 00:13:33,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>When you see this face,
it means I'm about to whoop ass.</b></font>

129
00:13:33,772 --> 00:13:35,902
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Get ready. Come on.</b></font>

130
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:41,740
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"You gave me life when I was dying.
And when I was leaving this world..."</b></font>

131
00:13:41,780 --> 00:13:43,490
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Quinn!
- Jesus, you scared me!</b></font>

132
00:13:43,574 --> 00:13:45,494
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I need to rely on you
to get him up and going.</b></font>

133
00:13:45,576 --> 00:13:47,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- He's lying around like a corpse.
- No, I did.</b></font>

134
00:13:47,578 --> 00:13:49,998
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, I need you to get him ready for school.</b></font>

135
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:52,080
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dad, I have to learn my lines!
When am I gonna do that?</b></font>

136
00:13:52,124 --> 00:13:55,424
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I need your help here.
I'm drowning. He's running late.</b></font>

137
00:13:55,460 --> 00:13:58,090
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You could have done this anytime.
You're being selfish.</b></font>

138
00:13:58,172 --> 00:14:00,672
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, I'm being really selfish
for worrying about my future?</b></font>

139
00:14:01,592 --> 00:14:02,592
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Just help me out.</b></font>

140
00:14:06,513 --> 00:14:07,513
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come on.</b></font>

141
00:14:12,644 --> 00:14:15,444
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Good timing, Hector.
Now, you get to see Quinn.</b></font>

142
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:17,190
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Were you waiting there?
- Shut up.</b></font>

143
00:14:18,567 --> 00:14:21,697
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I wasn't, like, waiting.
I just like... I just came out.</b></font>

144
00:14:21,778 --> 00:14:22,778
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I know.</b></font>

145
00:14:23,614 --> 00:14:26,994
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- So, what have you got first?
- I'm not going to school today.</b></font>

146
00:14:27,075 --> 00:14:29,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I have an audition for
a theater school in New York.</b></font>

147
00:14:30,078 --> 00:14:34,118
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you serious? That's awesome. Wow.
New York. It's far away.</b></font>

148
00:14:34,208 --> 00:14:37,538
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn. You gotta see these birds.</b></font>

149
00:14:37,628 --> 00:14:40,208
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There's a flock of them at city hall.</b></font>

150
00:14:40,297 --> 00:14:44,217
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But these ones are nicer,
but you can't eat them.</b></font>

151
00:14:44,885 --> 00:14:48,855
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sorry, kids. Sometimes she's not sure
about what she's saying.</b></font>

152
00:14:48,931 --> 00:14:50,061
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I know her.</b></font>

153
00:14:51,308 --> 00:14:52,348
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I know her.</b></font>

154
00:14:54,436 --> 00:14:56,396
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's what you have to look forward to
when you get old.</b></font>

155
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:59,150
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Yes. So do you.
- Yeah, but you'll get old first.</b></font>

156
00:15:00,859 --> 00:15:02,489
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, I can't wait for this thing.
We're taking the stairs.</b></font>

157
00:15:02,528 --> 00:15:04,068
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- No!
- See you later, Hector.</b></font>

158
00:15:06,990 --> 00:15:08,580
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>See you! Later.</b></font>

159
00:15:34,059 --> 00:15:35,689
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mom, help me get through this.</b></font>

160
00:15:58,500 --> 00:16:00,500
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Hi there, Quinn.
- Yeah. Hi.</b></font>

161
00:16:01,712 --> 00:16:05,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Thank you for coming in.
- Thank you. I'm so excited.</b></font>

162
00:16:06,008 --> 00:16:07,678
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm a huge fan of your school. I've...</b></font>

163
00:16:07,718 --> 00:16:09,588
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You know, it's always been
a dream of mine to go there.</b></font>

164
00:16:09,678 --> 00:16:10,678
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I've always...
- Great.</b></font>

165
00:16:11,054 --> 00:16:13,564
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Have you prepared something for us?
- Yeah, I have.</b></font>

166
00:16:17,311 --> 00:16:18,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Whenever you're ready.</b></font>

167
00:16:22,900 --> 00:16:24,400
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"I won't ever forget this.</b></font>

168
00:16:25,485 --> 00:16:29,315
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"You will go to the end of the world
and you will find me waiting there.</b></font>

169
00:16:29,406 --> 00:16:30,446
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"Your servant."</b></font>

170
00:16:36,246 --> 00:16:39,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's okay. It's okay.
You can start the scene again.</b></font>

171
00:16:39,791 --> 00:16:42,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, sorry. I'm sorry. I know it.</b></font>

172
00:16:43,712 --> 00:16:45,912
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Do you wanna take a break
and come back in a little bit?</b></font>

173
00:16:50,177 --> 00:16:53,347
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I hate him,
and I don't mean I pretend to hate him,</b></font>

174
00:16:53,430 --> 00:16:54,680
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>like, "really, I love you.
I'm just mad at you,"</b></font>

175
00:16:54,765 --> 00:16:56,605
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I actually literally hate him.</b></font>

176
00:16:57,100 --> 00:16:59,230
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Save the word "literally"
for when you're being literal.</b></font>

177
00:16:59,269 --> 00:17:01,979
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Shut up. God, don't ruin this.</b></font>

178
00:17:02,272 --> 00:17:04,272
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Look, we have a few months
of parental guidance left,</b></font>

179
00:17:04,316 --> 00:17:07,436
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and then this reality
we're currently living in is done.</b></font>

180
00:17:07,528 --> 00:17:08,898
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's what's so great about it.</b></font>

181
00:17:08,946 --> 00:17:12,116
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You pick a college on the opposite coast.
He becomes a weekly phone call.</b></font>

182
00:17:12,199 --> 00:17:14,909
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That turns into a monthly phone call
when you need money.</b></font>

183
00:17:14,952 --> 00:17:18,042
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's like he's not your dad anymore.
He's just a bank you visit on Thanksgiving.</b></font>

184
00:17:18,121 --> 00:17:20,251
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, but I'm not going anywhere, Maggie!</b></font>

185
00:17:20,290 --> 00:17:23,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I botched the audition
to the one school I wanted to go to.</b></font>

186
00:17:24,419 --> 00:17:27,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't have a backup plan. It's over.</b></font>

187
00:17:28,298 --> 00:17:31,008
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lord, you are so born
to be an actress, Brenner.</b></font>

188
00:17:31,093 --> 00:17:33,263
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- "It's over!"
- No, I'm serious.</b></font>

189
00:17:35,055 --> 00:17:36,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That school is all that I wanted.</b></font>

190
00:17:37,808 --> 00:17:40,728
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And my dad wants me here
raising my brother.</b></font>

191
00:17:43,689 --> 00:17:45,019
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You're gonna be gone.</b></font>

192
00:17:46,149 --> 00:17:47,319
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You're gonna be okay.</b></font>

193
00:17:48,652 --> 00:17:51,452
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, everybody always says that.</b></font>

194
00:17:52,739 --> 00:17:55,329
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hey. Come on.</b></font>

195
00:17:56,243 --> 00:17:58,503
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lesbifriends.</b></font>

196
00:17:59,329 --> 00:18:03,579
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Oh, no, you're right!
Where's the nearest Jesus camp?</b></font>

197
00:18:03,876 --> 00:18:05,666
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Have fun with your little boys.</b></font>

198
00:18:05,711 --> 00:18:08,341
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Goodbye. Goodbye.
- See you later, ladies.</b></font>

199
00:18:09,840 --> 00:18:11,010
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Let's get out of here.</b></font>

200
00:18:13,802 --> 00:18:15,012
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come on, Lesbo!</b></font>

201
00:18:29,193 --> 00:18:32,323
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn! No! No!</b></font>

202
00:18:36,033 --> 00:18:37,953
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Someone help us, please!</b></font>

203
00:18:38,577 --> 00:18:40,907
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>On my count. One, two, three!</b></font>

204
00:18:48,378 --> 00:18:49,798
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Get the crash cart here.</b></font>

205
00:18:52,925 --> 00:18:54,055
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, get a new line in her.</b></font>

206
00:18:55,969 --> 00:18:57,469
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Monitor's showing V-Tach.</b></font>

207
00:18:59,306 --> 00:19:01,587
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, we got multiple compound fractures
on the right leg.</b></font>

208
00:19:06,897 --> 00:19:10,817
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- BP is 163, dropping. Rate's degrading.
- Okay, give me one amp of EPI.</b></font>

209
00:19:11,693 --> 00:19:12,693
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Paddles on 360.</b></font>

210
00:19:13,403 --> 00:19:17,453
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Charge on 360! Do it! We got...</b></font>

211
00:20:08,500 --> 00:20:13,130
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, we got her. We got her back.
Let's keep her stable, folks.</b></font>

212
00:20:18,677 --> 00:20:19,797
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mom?</b></font>

213
00:20:24,850 --> 00:20:25,980
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hey, it's dad.</b></font>

214
00:20:26,643 --> 00:20:28,313
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Honey, I'm here.</b></font>

215
00:20:34,067 --> 00:20:35,737
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Do you remember anything?</b></font>

216
00:20:36,653 --> 00:20:38,493
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I was with Maggie.</b></font>

217
00:20:43,368 --> 00:20:45,698
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And there was this man waving at me.</b></font>

218
00:20:49,082 --> 00:20:51,172
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He was at the theater, too.</b></font>

219
00:20:55,339 --> 00:20:57,169
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And then everything went dark.</b></font>

220
00:21:14,900 --> 00:21:15,900
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>One second, hon.</b></font>

221
00:21:21,823 --> 00:21:24,993
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Mr. Sean. How are you doing?
- Hey, Harry.</b></font>

222
00:21:25,911 --> 00:21:29,501
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You know, we're really sorry to hear
about what happened to your daughter.</b></font>

223
00:21:31,208 --> 00:21:34,918
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thanks, Harry.
She's here. That's what counts.</b></font>

224
00:21:35,003 --> 00:21:36,923
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The man who can't breathe.</b></font>

225
00:21:37,714 --> 00:21:40,054
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The man who lives in the vents.</b></font>

226
00:21:42,344 --> 00:21:46,264
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I heard him saying your name last night.</b></font>

227
00:21:46,682 --> 00:21:50,812
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I heard him in your room
while you were gone.</b></font>

228
00:21:55,524 --> 00:21:57,734
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's up there right now,</b></font>

229
00:21:59,653 --> 00:22:02,743
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>standing in your room.</b></font>

230
00:22:03,198 --> 00:22:04,568
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You will see him.</b></font>

231
00:22:08,245 --> 00:22:10,085
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Surprise!
- Surprise!</b></font>

232
00:22:10,163 --> 00:22:11,963
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Welcome home, bad ass.</b></font>

233
00:22:13,083 --> 00:22:16,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- My gosh, Quinn.
- Yeah, I'm all busted.</b></font>

234
00:22:17,671 --> 00:22:19,881
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Wheelchair's just until
the bones in her legs heal.</b></font>

235
00:22:19,923 --> 00:22:22,093
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. Thank God. Thank God.</b></font>

236
00:22:22,134 --> 00:22:24,304
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Listen, I'm just happy
that you're gonna get better.</b></font>

237
00:22:24,386 --> 00:22:25,676
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Some people are crazy.</b></font>

238
00:22:25,762 --> 00:22:27,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The way they drive around
this neighborhood, you know?</b></font>

239
00:22:29,099 --> 00:22:32,389
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I'm so sorry this happened to you.
- Yeah, it's pretty embarrassing.</b></font>

240
00:22:33,520 --> 00:22:35,440
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I sent some flowers.
- We got 'em.</b></font>

241
00:22:39,443 --> 00:22:42,073
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hey. Can I tag this thing or what?
Is that a cliché?</b></font>

242
00:22:42,112 --> 00:22:43,742
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No. Knock yourself out.</b></font>

243
00:22:52,623 --> 00:22:54,333
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Wow, you have been saving that one.</b></font>

244
00:22:54,416 --> 00:22:56,456
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You just had to wait
for Quinn to get hit by a car.</b></font>

245
00:22:58,170 --> 00:23:01,010
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I think she's done being shown off now.</b></font>

246
00:23:01,089 --> 00:23:03,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Listen, we just wanted
to see you, Quinn. Okay.</b></font>

247
00:23:03,133 --> 00:23:04,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Listen, anything you need.</b></font>

248
00:23:04,843 --> 00:23:06,283
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Thanks, Ernesto.
- Well, I mean it.</b></font>

249
00:23:07,179 --> 00:23:08,219
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>See you later.</b></font>

250
00:23:13,310 --> 00:23:14,480
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Home again home.</b></font>

251
00:23:26,949 --> 00:23:28,029
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>All right, ready?</b></font>

252
00:23:29,326 --> 00:23:30,826
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>One, two, three.</b></font>

253
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:38,710
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Great neighbors we have.</b></font>

254
00:23:39,503 --> 00:23:41,053
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Crazy cat lady on one side</b></font>

255
00:23:41,129 --> 00:23:43,419
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and a boy who's clearly
in love with you on the other.</b></font>

256
00:23:44,007 --> 00:23:45,377
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's not in love with me.</b></font>

257
00:23:47,511 --> 00:23:51,141
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You know, everyone that looks at me
isn't in love with me, dad.</b></font>

258
00:23:51,181 --> 00:23:53,061
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Especially since I'm a cripple now.</b></font>

259
00:23:53,141 --> 00:23:55,851
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hey. No sarcasm.</b></font>

260
00:23:57,229 --> 00:24:00,519
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Not since I got you
such an awesome gift basket.</b></font>

261
00:24:01,775 --> 00:24:03,435
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Everything you like. Books.</b></font>

262
00:24:06,238 --> 00:24:09,028
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Bell. In case you want me to wait on you.</b></font>

263
00:24:10,242 --> 00:24:13,242
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Some French food? French onion dip?</b></font>

264
00:24:15,998 --> 00:24:17,038
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Snacks.</b></font>

265
00:24:17,749 --> 00:24:18,749
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What?</b></font>

266
00:24:19,710 --> 00:24:21,040
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm vegetarian.</b></font>

267
00:24:23,172 --> 00:24:25,222
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Really?
- Yeah.</b></font>

268
00:24:25,799 --> 00:24:28,129
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- When did that happen?
- It doesn't matter.</b></font>

269
00:24:29,553 --> 00:24:31,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Thank you.
- Yeah.</b></font>

270
00:24:34,183 --> 00:24:35,233
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So...</b></font>

271
00:24:36,351 --> 00:24:38,941
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Did any letters come from any schools?</b></font>

272
00:24:39,021 --> 00:24:41,151
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, I don't want you
to worry about that right now.</b></font>

273
00:24:41,231 --> 00:24:44,151
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The only thing I want you
to think about right now is getting better.</b></font>

274
00:24:44,234 --> 00:24:45,904
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Understand?</b></font>

275
00:24:45,944 --> 00:24:49,574
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Think of it as a gift-wrapped excuse
to do your favorite thing in the world.</b></font>

276
00:24:50,365 --> 00:24:51,445
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sleep.</b></font>

277
00:26:06,900 --> 00:26:07,940
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hey.</b></font>

278
00:26:08,944 --> 00:26:10,574
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You need me? I thought I heard the Bell.</b></font>

279
00:26:12,322 --> 00:26:13,372
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, I'm fine.</b></font>

280
00:26:28,338 --> 00:26:29,338
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Good night, Warren.</b></font>

281
00:26:52,112 --> 00:26:53,202
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Good night, Jack.</b></font>

282
00:30:12,187 --> 00:30:13,477
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What the hell was that?</b></font>

283
00:30:23,156 --> 00:30:25,986
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm not making this up, Mel.
It cracked my ceiling.</b></font>

284
00:30:26,076 --> 00:30:27,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm not saying you are.</b></font>

285
00:30:28,871 --> 00:30:32,461
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm just showing you that
there's nobody living above you right now.</b></font>

286
00:30:32,541 --> 00:30:33,631
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>See?</b></font>

287
00:30:34,751 --> 00:30:36,591
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. Well, I heard it.</b></font>

288
00:30:39,548 --> 00:30:41,088
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And it came from that room.</b></font>

289
00:30:50,142 --> 00:30:51,432
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mel, come look at this.</b></font>

290
00:31:11,914 --> 00:31:15,964
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What do you say now? No one up here?
- I don't know what to tell you.</b></font>

291
00:31:17,044 --> 00:31:19,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Tell me who's gonna pay
for the crack in my ceiling.</b></font>

292
00:31:19,963 --> 00:31:23,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Why can't I ever...
Quinn, where's the frying pan, please?</b></font>

293
00:31:23,759 --> 00:31:27,549
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Third drawer in the far left.
- Yeah. I looked there already.</b></font>

294
00:31:28,305 --> 00:31:30,565
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You know what? I can't take this right now.
I'm too busy.</b></font>

295
00:31:30,641 --> 00:31:32,431
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Alex! No eggs this morning.</b></font>

296
00:31:32,476 --> 00:31:34,886
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Just find what you can in the fridge
for breakfast, okay?</b></font>

297
00:31:35,312 --> 00:31:36,312
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Whatever!</b></font>

298
00:31:36,355 --> 00:31:39,485
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Come on, Quinn. Eat your breakfast.
- I don't want to.</b></font>

299
00:31:39,525 --> 00:31:42,445
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- You have to.
- I can't taste it.</b></font>

300
00:31:43,320 --> 00:31:45,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I can't taste anything anymore.</b></font>

301
00:31:46,198 --> 00:31:47,988
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Alex, are you dressed?
- Yes!</b></font>

302
00:31:48,075 --> 00:31:49,495
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I went to see a psychic.</b></font>

303
00:31:50,452 --> 00:31:52,162
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I wanted to talk to mom.</b></font>

304
00:31:52,913 --> 00:31:54,163
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You what?</b></font>

305
00:31:54,248 --> 00:31:56,918
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I went and saw a psychic woman
named Elise.</b></font>

306
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:58,630
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Claire's mom gave me her address.</b></font>

307
00:31:59,545 --> 00:32:02,845
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- When was that?
- Like a month or so back.</b></font>

308
00:32:02,881 --> 00:32:04,551
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Strange things have been happening.</b></font>

309
00:32:06,510 --> 00:32:11,010
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Like that knocking I heard last night,
I think that was mom trying to reach me.</b></font>

310
00:32:11,056 --> 00:32:12,176
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn.</b></font>

311
00:32:13,642 --> 00:32:15,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't want you to get any funny ideas.</b></font>

312
00:32:15,644 --> 00:32:18,524
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You know, these nutcases are...
They're paid to give you hope.</b></font>

313
00:32:18,564 --> 00:32:19,864
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's what they do. They make stuff up.</b></font>

314
00:32:19,940 --> 00:32:24,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Why couldn't that have been her, though?
What if she's trying to tell me something?</b></font>

315
00:32:24,403 --> 00:32:26,953
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Why don't you ever wanna talk about her
or acknowledge her?</b></font>

316
00:32:27,364 --> 00:32:30,374
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I do talk about her.
- No, you don't! You just fight with me!</b></font>

317
00:32:30,450 --> 00:32:33,050
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You keep all this chaos
so you can pretend that she never existed.</b></font>

318
00:32:34,496 --> 00:32:35,706
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, Quinn.</b></font>

319
00:32:37,416 --> 00:32:40,036
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I see her every single day</b></font>

320
00:32:42,045 --> 00:32:43,545
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>when I look at you.</b></font>

321
00:34:08,966 --> 00:34:12,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Fine. I'll help her,
but you're staying here.</b></font>

322
00:34:19,643 --> 00:34:22,523
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm reaching out to Lilith Brenner.</b></font>

323
00:34:23,313 --> 00:34:25,653
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>If you can hear me, please answer me.</b></font>

324
00:34:29,820 --> 00:34:33,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Your daughter may be in danger.
She needs your help.</b></font>

325
00:34:36,785 --> 00:34:39,495
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Please, Lily, answer me.</b></font>

326
00:34:40,163 --> 00:34:42,043
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I need to speak with you.</b></font>

327
00:34:44,960 --> 00:34:48,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lily, please, show yourself.</b></font>

328
00:36:00,369 --> 00:36:01,749
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What do you want from her?</b></font>

329
00:36:02,621 --> 00:36:04,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I know you're not her mother.</b></font>

330
00:36:05,249 --> 00:36:07,579
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She thinks you are, but you aren't.</b></font>

331
00:36:09,253 --> 00:36:10,883
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And I'm not afraid of you.</b></font>

332
00:36:55,465 --> 00:36:56,755
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I know you're there.</b></font>

333
00:37:06,643 --> 00:37:09,313
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I've fought many like
you in my time, demon.</b></font>

334
00:37:18,739 --> 00:37:20,029
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Show yourself.</b></font>

335
00:38:03,367 --> 00:38:04,827
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I can't.</b></font>

336
00:38:05,869 --> 00:38:07,619
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I can't do this anymore.</b></font>

337
00:38:08,789 --> 00:38:13,039
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Kate wittier is still a bitch.
Mr. Paul is still hot.</b></font>

338
00:38:13,961 --> 00:38:17,341
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hector is still asking about you
in a really unsubtle way,</b></font>

339
00:38:17,381 --> 00:38:19,721
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>like he just needs to stop.</b></font>

340
00:38:20,717 --> 00:38:23,467
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And everyone at school is pretending
that they care about prom</b></font>

341
00:38:23,554 --> 00:38:26,314
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and that they're going
to wear ironic costumes.</b></font>

342
00:38:26,682 --> 00:38:30,942
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- That sounds so fun.
- No, it's not. It's the worse. Believe me.</b></font>

343
00:38:31,895 --> 00:38:34,645
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I wish someone would run over
my legs with a truck.</b></font>

344
00:38:38,735 --> 00:38:40,575
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Wait. So, how's your college
application going?</b></font>

345
00:38:40,612 --> 00:38:44,412
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, we're gonna talk about you.
How's it going with your dad?</b></font>

346
00:38:45,158 --> 00:38:47,238
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's taking all this time off work.</b></font>

347
00:38:47,327 --> 00:38:48,997
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's out talking to his boss
about it right now.</b></font>

348
00:38:49,079 --> 00:38:52,749
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- It's like this whole big situation.
- That sucks.</b></font>

349
00:38:53,709 --> 00:38:57,919
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Well, I don't know, what do you do
when you need to go to the bathroom?</b></font>

350
00:39:01,091 --> 00:39:05,851
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No! No. No way. You're kidding me!</b></font>

351
00:39:06,763 --> 00:39:08,893
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Hey, is that Alex?
- What?</b></font>

352
00:39:09,433 --> 00:39:10,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Standing right next to you.</b></font>

353
00:39:13,604 --> 00:39:17,324
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What are you talking about?
- Alex. He's right...</b></font>

354
00:39:18,442 --> 00:39:19,532
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Maggie?</b></font>

355
00:39:23,947 --> 00:39:25,277
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Maggie?</b></font>

356
00:41:31,742 --> 00:41:32,832
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn!</b></font>

357
00:41:36,288 --> 00:41:38,118
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What's happening? Quinn!</b></font>

358
00:41:38,207 --> 00:41:41,667
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Are you hurt? Are you okay? Are you hurt?
- My neck!</b></font>

359
00:41:41,752 --> 00:41:44,092
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Someone's in here.
- There's someone in here?</b></font>

360
00:41:47,132 --> 00:41:48,932
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm here now. It's okay.</b></font>

361
00:41:53,972 --> 00:41:55,022
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Careful.</b></font>

362
00:41:55,557 --> 00:41:58,637
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This will prevent her from moving in a way
that could injure her neck further.</b></font>

363
00:41:59,353 --> 00:42:00,443
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Easy.</b></font>

364
00:42:04,775 --> 00:42:05,945
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Just hold still.</b></font>

365
00:42:10,906 --> 00:42:11,986
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

366
00:42:13,909 --> 00:42:16,449
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn, what happened?</b></font>

367
00:42:17,621 --> 00:42:19,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I was thrown out of bed.</b></font>

368
00:42:21,041 --> 00:42:23,671
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But there was no one in your room.
I would've seen them.</b></font>

369
00:42:25,337 --> 00:42:26,917
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It wasn't a person.</b></font>

370
00:42:28,173 --> 00:42:29,223
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It was...</b></font>

371
00:42:32,135 --> 00:42:35,175
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Before I thought that it was mom
trying to contact me.</b></font>

372
00:42:37,224 --> 00:42:40,894
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But it's not. It's something else.</b></font>

373
00:42:42,354 --> 00:42:46,864
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Are you sure it wasn't just a bad dream?
- No! I saw him.</b></font>

374
00:42:48,110 --> 00:42:49,780
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He had on a mask.</b></font>

375
00:42:51,405 --> 00:42:53,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He had on a breathing mask.</b></font>

376
00:42:54,533 --> 00:42:55,833
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I believe you.</b></font>

377
00:42:57,995 --> 00:42:59,955
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I do. You're gonna be okay now.</b></font>

378
00:43:01,123 --> 00:43:02,123
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Get some rest out here.</b></font>

379
00:43:18,682 --> 00:43:20,602
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I think we got everything we need.</b></font>

380
00:43:22,102 --> 00:43:24,102
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come on. Thank you very much.</b></font>

381
00:43:28,901 --> 00:43:29,901
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Harry?</b></font>

382
00:43:34,698 --> 00:43:35,698
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's gone.</b></font>

383
00:43:36,950 --> 00:43:38,450
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She just wouldn't wake up.</b></font>

384
00:43:40,120 --> 00:43:43,750
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Harry, I'm sorry.</b></font>

385
00:43:45,125 --> 00:43:50,205
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>People called her the "cat lady," "crazy lady,"
but she wasn't any of that.</b></font>

386
00:43:51,173 --> 00:43:54,133
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She was somebody. She meant something.
She was my wife.</b></font>

387
00:43:56,720 --> 00:43:59,430
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We were together 52 years.</b></font>

388
00:44:00,724 --> 00:44:03,064
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She had a whole life before she got sick.</b></font>

389
00:44:06,438 --> 00:44:07,648
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She was beautiful.</b></font>

390
00:44:08,565 --> 00:44:10,935
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So, so beautiful.</b></font>

391
00:44:11,485 --> 00:44:13,495
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The most beautiful girl in the whole town.</b></font>

392
00:44:16,657 --> 00:44:18,697
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I knew she didn't have long,</b></font>

393
00:44:18,742 --> 00:44:21,582
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and I tried my best to tell her
what she meant to me.</b></font>

394
00:44:22,788 --> 00:44:24,328
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The sad part is</b></font>

395
00:44:25,791 --> 00:44:28,381
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't think she understood a word
I was trying to say.</b></font>

396
00:44:29,378 --> 00:44:30,958
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She knew what you said.</b></font>

397
00:44:32,381 --> 00:44:34,221
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She knows how much you love her.</b></font>

398
00:44:35,342 --> 00:44:42,182
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Harry, if you ever need anything,
anything, just tell me, okay?</b></font>

399
00:44:44,768 --> 00:44:46,018
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thanks.</b></font>

400
00:46:45,138 --> 00:46:49,058
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Help. Help!</b></font>

401
00:46:49,101 --> 00:46:53,101
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Help! Help!</b></font>

402
00:47:02,072 --> 00:47:03,162
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dad.</b></font>

403
00:47:33,562 --> 00:47:36,152
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dad! Help!</b></font>

404
00:47:36,607 --> 00:47:38,107
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Help!</b></font>

405
00:47:44,114 --> 00:47:45,574
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Help!</b></font>

406
00:47:46,700 --> 00:47:48,660
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dad! Dad, help me!</b></font>

407
00:47:49,620 --> 00:47:50,790
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Dad!
- Quinn!</b></font>

408
00:47:57,294 --> 00:47:58,844
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What are you doing up here?</b></font>

409
00:48:03,217 --> 00:48:04,927
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dad, I told you.</b></font>

410
00:49:11,034 --> 00:49:12,454
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Jesus, he jumped.</b></font>

411
00:49:24,464 --> 00:49:25,974
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Quinn!
- Dad!</b></font>

412
00:49:26,633 --> 00:49:29,223
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dad, help! Help!</b></font>

413
00:49:33,307 --> 00:49:35,727
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn. Quinn.</b></font>

414
00:49:41,648 --> 00:49:44,068
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Who's there?
- It's Sean Brenner.</b></font>

415
00:49:45,777 --> 00:49:47,237
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm Quinn's father.</b></font>

416
00:49:58,165 --> 00:50:00,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I told her I don't really
give readings anymore.</b></font>

417
00:50:01,084 --> 00:50:03,424
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Believe me, I wanna help,</b></font>

418
00:50:03,462 --> 00:50:05,552
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>but this ability I have
to contact the other side,</b></font>

419
00:50:05,589 --> 00:50:08,259
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I promised myself I wouldn't do it anymore.</b></font>

420
00:50:09,092 --> 00:50:11,052
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Look, I don't know
anything about this stuff.</b></font>

421
00:50:12,721 --> 00:50:15,271
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't know what's real, what's not.</b></font>

422
00:50:15,349 --> 00:50:17,139
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I only know her, she's real.</b></font>

423
00:50:17,726 --> 00:50:19,976
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's my daughter,
and something's trying to kill her,</b></font>

424
00:50:20,062 --> 00:50:22,112
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and I don't know what to do to stop it.</b></font>

425
00:50:23,398 --> 00:50:26,108
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I can't let that happen again,
not after my wife.</b></font>

426
00:50:27,778 --> 00:50:29,738
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She told me that you lost your wife.</b></font>

427
00:50:31,073 --> 00:50:32,373
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm so sorry.</b></font>

428
00:50:41,708 --> 00:50:44,708
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Loving someone
is just delayed pain, isn't it?</b></font>

429
00:50:46,296 --> 00:50:48,456
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Eventually you're gonna lose them
one way or the other.</b></font>

430
00:50:52,344 --> 00:50:55,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I lost my husband a year ago.</b></font>

431
00:50:58,725 --> 00:51:00,135
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He took his own life.</b></font>

432
00:51:01,228 --> 00:51:02,978
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So, I couldn't even blame fate.</b></font>

433
00:51:06,483 --> 00:51:11,323
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He'd suffered depression before,
but I never thought that...</b></font>

434
00:51:13,323 --> 00:51:16,163
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There are so many things
I needed to say to him.</b></font>

435
00:51:18,829 --> 00:51:20,329
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Goodbye would've been nice.</b></font>

436
00:51:27,504 --> 00:51:31,174
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So, I tried to contact him.
I just couldn't help it.</b></font>

437
00:51:40,517 --> 00:51:45,397
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There are two worlds
that exist beyond ours, Mr. Brenner.</b></font>

438
00:51:48,525 --> 00:51:51,645
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Think of them as light and dark.</b></font>

439
00:51:53,363 --> 00:51:57,953
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I visited the dark, looking for him,
something I'd never done before.</b></font>

440
00:52:03,540 --> 00:52:06,380
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Something we living people
are not supposed to do.</b></font>

441
00:52:08,629 --> 00:52:10,879
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But someone followed me back.</b></font>

442
00:52:12,466 --> 00:52:16,756
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>A woman, an entity driven by Evil.</b></font>

443
00:52:19,348 --> 00:52:23,478
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Ever since then,
whenever I use my ability, this woman,</b></font>

444
00:52:24,728 --> 00:52:26,558
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I could hear her in my head,</b></font>

445
00:52:26,605 --> 00:52:31,575
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>screaming over and over
that she's going to kill me.</b></font>

446
00:52:36,323 --> 00:52:37,323
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I think...</b></font>

447
00:52:38,325 --> 00:52:43,755
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No, I know if I continue with this work,</b></font>

448
00:52:43,789 --> 00:52:44,999
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>she's going to kill me.</b></font>

449
00:52:46,458 --> 00:52:48,248
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Then just visit Quinn.</b></font>

450
00:52:50,128 --> 00:52:53,128
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's all I ask.
You don't have to do anything else.</b></font>

451
00:52:53,215 --> 00:52:54,385
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Just talk to her.</b></font>

452
00:53:00,264 --> 00:53:01,314
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

453
00:53:08,772 --> 00:53:10,272
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We're gonna be okay.</b></font>

454
00:53:30,002 --> 00:53:31,092
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn?</b></font>

455
00:53:33,130 --> 00:53:34,340
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise.</b></font>

456
00:53:35,799 --> 00:53:36,799
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You came.</b></font>

457
00:53:36,925 --> 00:53:38,635
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lucky you look good in white.</b></font>

458
00:53:43,307 --> 00:53:44,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What's happening to me?</b></font>

459
00:53:47,603 --> 00:53:49,733
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>One night after you came to see me,</b></font>

460
00:53:53,442 --> 00:53:54,612
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I had a vision of you.</b></font>

461
00:53:54,651 --> 00:53:56,361
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You were standing in the dark.</b></font>

462
00:53:57,321 --> 00:53:59,451
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>A man was walking toward you.</b></font>

463
00:54:01,158 --> 00:54:03,078
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>A man who couldn't breathe.</b></font>

464
00:54:05,537 --> 00:54:07,457
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I've been to that dark place, too.</b></font>

465
00:54:08,832 --> 00:54:11,002
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's not a place for pure souls.</b></font>

466
00:54:12,044 --> 00:54:14,464
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It is very dangerous.</b></font>

467
00:54:15,214 --> 00:54:16,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>When you go there,</b></font>

468
00:54:18,675 --> 00:54:20,675
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>things come back with you.</b></font>

469
00:54:21,720 --> 00:54:23,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't wanna die, Elise.</b></font>

470
00:54:27,518 --> 00:54:29,388
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You have a long life ahead of you.</b></font>

471
00:54:32,481 --> 00:54:33,861
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I cross my heart.</b></font>

472
00:54:36,735 --> 00:54:39,355
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm here with Quinn Brenner.</b></font>

473
00:54:41,365 --> 00:54:44,705
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I want to speak to the entity
that has attached itself to her.</b></font>

474
00:54:48,705 --> 00:54:50,075
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Can you hear me?</b></font>

475
00:54:54,753 --> 00:54:55,923
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you there?</b></font>

476
00:56:32,726 --> 00:56:36,226
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Where is the man who can't breathe?
- I wasn't trying to upset him.</b></font>

477
00:57:04,383 --> 00:57:07,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Get away from me! Get away!</b></font>

478
00:57:37,207 --> 00:57:39,577
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm not going any further.</b></font>

479
00:59:17,307 --> 00:59:22,597
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I always wanted to know how I would go</b></font>

480
00:59:22,646 --> 00:59:28,026
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>tell me, friend, how I meet my end</b></font>

481
01:00:00,184 --> 01:00:01,274
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>no!</b></font>

482
01:00:11,028 --> 01:00:12,028
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise!</b></font>

483
01:00:16,783 --> 01:00:17,873
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise. Elise.</b></font>

484
01:00:21,914 --> 01:00:24,084
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise! Wake up! Elise!</b></font>

485
01:00:30,714 --> 01:00:32,594
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Wake up! Elise!</b></font>

486
01:00:42,559 --> 01:00:47,559
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>The woman that wants to kill me
was waiting for me.</b></font>

487
01:00:48,398 --> 01:00:51,988
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm sorry. I can't. I can't help you.</b></font>

488
01:00:52,819 --> 01:00:55,909
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm sorry. I can't do it.</b></font>

489
01:01:05,082 --> 01:01:07,212
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm telling you, dad. These guys can help.</b></font>

490
01:01:08,085 --> 01:01:09,545
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Throughout this hospital over the years,</b></font>

491
01:01:09,586 --> 01:01:12,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>a lot of paranormal experts
have come in here and then the...</b></font>

492
01:01:12,172 --> 01:01:13,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't know. They look like fools.</b></font>

493
01:01:14,424 --> 01:01:15,974
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>They found a house
that was being haunted,</b></font>

494
01:01:16,051 --> 01:01:18,221
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and they cleaned it. Trust me.</b></font>

495
01:01:18,929 --> 01:01:19,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't.</b></font>

496
01:01:20,931 --> 01:01:22,931
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dad, we have to do something.</b></font>

497
01:01:29,022 --> 01:01:31,362
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I'm Sean, Quinn's dad.
- Hey. Specs.</b></font>

498
01:01:31,441 --> 01:01:33,571
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Tucker.
- This is Alex.</b></font>

499
01:01:34,486 --> 01:01:36,236
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, he's a big fan of your website.</b></font>

500
01:01:36,280 --> 01:01:38,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Web series.
- Web series.</b></font>

501
01:01:38,824 --> 01:01:41,334
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I showed him that one where you guys
get the Ghost out of that one hotel.</b></font>

502
01:01:41,410 --> 01:01:43,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- The boiler room Ghost?
- Yeah.</b></font>

503
01:01:43,370 --> 01:01:45,460
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- That was a good one.
- Yeah. Thanks, little man.</b></font>

504
01:01:45,497 --> 01:01:48,537
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Some of my best editing on that one.
- Definitely some of our best editing.</b></font>

505
01:01:48,625 --> 01:01:51,995
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So, do you guys do this kind of thing often?
This Ghost hunting?</b></font>

506
01:01:52,087 --> 01:01:56,507
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- All the time.
- Yeah. It's actually all we do.</b></font>

507
01:01:56,592 --> 01:02:00,052
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We literally don't do anything else.
Just this.</b></font>

508
01:02:01,513 --> 01:02:02,643
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So what happens now?</b></font>

509
01:02:03,473 --> 01:02:04,893
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Probably five, maybe four.</b></font>

510
01:02:06,894 --> 01:02:07,894
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Excuse me?</b></font>

511
01:02:10,731 --> 01:02:14,481
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And I have to call you back.
I'm just with some peeps. Roger that.</b></font>

512
01:02:15,944 --> 01:02:17,324
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come on. She's in here.</b></font>

513
01:02:17,988 --> 01:02:20,158
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Thank you. Pass the trash.
- Here you go.</b></font>

514
01:02:22,034 --> 01:02:23,124
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thanks.</b></font>

515
01:02:24,494 --> 01:02:25,504
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Excuse me.</b></font>

516
01:02:32,044 --> 01:02:35,594
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Now, this custom-made camera of mine
is outfitted with a small lens.</b></font>

517
01:02:36,215 --> 01:02:40,185
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Basically a hidden camera.
- It's not basic and it's not hidden.</b></font>

518
01:02:40,511 --> 01:02:43,931
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>'Cause we're keeping it right out in the
open to capture whatever may occur tonight.</b></font>

519
01:02:44,014 --> 01:02:45,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We do hide it though, sometimes.</b></font>

520
01:02:50,687 --> 01:02:51,687
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thanks.</b></font>

521
01:02:53,148 --> 01:02:55,358
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is our sound backup.</b></font>

522
01:02:56,568 --> 01:02:59,988
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Any noises will be recorded right here.</b></font>

523
01:03:00,822 --> 01:03:02,822
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What do I do?
- Nothing.</b></font>

524
01:03:02,866 --> 01:03:05,036
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You just go to sleep
like you normally would.</b></font>

525
01:03:07,704 --> 01:03:09,464
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We are the ones who stay awake.</b></font>

526
01:03:18,382 --> 01:03:19,512
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hello, Elise.</b></font>

527
01:03:20,884 --> 01:03:22,224
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's been too long.</b></font>

528
01:03:23,637 --> 01:03:25,637
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I save you for special occasions.</b></font>

529
01:03:34,565 --> 01:03:35,615
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's her.</b></font>

530
01:03:36,859 --> 01:03:41,149
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She says one day, eventually,
I'm going to die by her hand,</b></font>

531
01:03:42,281 --> 01:03:43,411
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and I believe her.</b></font>

532
01:03:44,908 --> 01:03:46,988
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's why I had to stop using my gift.</b></font>

533
01:03:48,996 --> 01:03:50,576
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But now I'm realizing</b></font>

534
01:03:52,749 --> 01:03:54,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>my gift is all I have.</b></font>

535
01:03:55,502 --> 01:03:57,092
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's all I am.</b></font>

536
01:03:57,838 --> 01:04:01,548
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>First of all, okay,
you are more than one thing.</b></font>

537
01:04:03,218 --> 01:04:07,468
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And, second, you've been helping people
get rid of these spirits for so long.</b></font>

538
01:04:07,931 --> 01:04:10,101
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Well, eventually, one of them
was gonna come after you.</b></font>

539
01:04:11,435 --> 01:04:12,985
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You can't be afraid of her.</b></font>

540
01:04:14,271 --> 01:04:16,311
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>All right, you're stronger than her.</b></font>

541
01:04:18,150 --> 01:04:21,110
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- You're alive.
- Yes, I'm alive.</b></font>

542
01:04:21,445 --> 01:04:25,415
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But I have spent more time on this earth
among the dead than the living.</b></font>

543
01:04:27,618 --> 01:04:31,708
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Do you really think we help people, Carl?
- We do what we can.</b></font>

544
01:04:33,498 --> 01:04:35,578
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>If someone gets attacked
by a person on the street,</b></font>

545
01:04:35,626 --> 01:04:37,916
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>they can go to the police.</b></font>

546
01:04:37,961 --> 01:04:40,921
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>If they're attacked
by something they can't see,</b></font>

547
01:04:40,964 --> 01:04:45,594
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>something they can't comprehend,
they only have people like us to go to.</b></font>

548
01:04:45,636 --> 01:04:46,636
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Here.</b></font>

549
01:04:50,641 --> 01:04:52,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Look at what you did for that family.</b></font>

550
01:04:53,477 --> 01:04:54,517
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You saved them.</b></font>

551
01:04:55,312 --> 01:04:58,482
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That boy is a grown man now
with a son of his own.</b></font>

552
01:04:59,316 --> 01:05:02,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I don't want you to stop
helping families like them.</b></font>

553
01:05:02,569 --> 01:05:04,319
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>They need you too much.</b></font>

554
01:05:38,689 --> 01:05:41,319
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What's that?
- I don't know.</b></font>

555
01:05:49,700 --> 01:05:50,830
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's up.</b></font>

556
01:05:57,958 --> 01:06:00,708
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What? No. No.</b></font>

557
01:06:00,794 --> 01:06:04,264
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- She can't be doing that. That's impossible.
- Well, she's doing it.</b></font>

558
01:06:22,441 --> 01:06:24,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Go. Go!</b></font>

559
01:06:51,303 --> 01:06:54,853
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's gone. Come on. Look.</b></font>

560
01:06:59,895 --> 01:07:01,235
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I gotta go get her.</b></font>

561
01:07:02,189 --> 01:07:04,319
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. Good idea. You should.</b></font>

562
01:07:18,956 --> 01:07:19,956
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn?</b></font>

563
01:07:23,544 --> 01:07:24,544
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn?</b></font>

564
01:07:36,056 --> 01:07:37,216
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where are you, honey?</b></font>

565
01:07:39,852 --> 01:07:40,852
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Wait.</b></font>

566
01:07:54,491 --> 01:07:57,411
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Here. Keep the flashlight on the closet.
- Yeah.</b></font>

567
01:08:31,695 --> 01:08:32,815
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She took it off.</b></font>

568
01:09:44,393 --> 01:09:45,443
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn.</b></font>

569
01:09:48,522 --> 01:09:49,522
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Wait.</b></font>

570
01:09:53,026 --> 01:09:55,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You're a useless fucking father.</b></font>

571
01:09:55,612 --> 01:09:58,742
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Your wife had to die to get away from you.
- No.</b></font>

572
01:09:58,782 --> 01:10:00,992
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And now I'd rather be dead, too,</b></font>

573
01:10:01,076 --> 01:10:04,946
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>but I'm gonna keep you alive
to watch you suffer.</b></font>

574
01:10:04,997 --> 01:10:09,417
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'll be waiting in the dark
when the pain finally kills you.</b></font>

575
01:10:11,461 --> 01:10:14,671
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- No! No!
- Don't!</b></font>

576
01:10:17,301 --> 01:10:18,301
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn!</b></font>

577
01:10:19,136 --> 01:10:20,596
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No! No!</b></font>

578
01:10:29,062 --> 01:10:30,062
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hand me that wire!</b></font>

579
01:10:41,450 --> 01:10:43,240
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay! Okay.</b></font>

580
01:10:50,501 --> 01:10:54,711
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What do we do now?
- I don't know. We are not qualified for this.</b></font>

581
01:10:54,838 --> 01:10:57,508
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We sit in dark empty rooms.
This is way out of our league!</b></font>

582
01:10:57,591 --> 01:10:58,631
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What do you mean?</b></font>

583
01:10:58,675 --> 01:11:00,675
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you telling me you have
no idea how to help us?</b></font>

584
01:11:01,428 --> 01:11:02,428
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No.</b></font>

585
01:11:02,513 --> 01:11:05,393
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Are you saying that you're a couple of
Goddamn Internet pranksters?</b></font>

586
01:11:05,474 --> 01:11:08,814
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I let you in my house, you...
- Dad! Stop it, dad! Stop it!</b></font>

587
01:11:08,852 --> 01:11:10,982
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- This isn't going to help Quinn!
- Get out! Get out of my house!</b></font>

588
01:11:11,063 --> 01:11:12,063
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Get out!</b></font>

589
01:11:14,816 --> 01:11:17,986
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Let them stay. We may need them.
- What? What for?</b></font>

590
01:11:19,821 --> 01:11:23,701
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>To help me get rid of the foul parasite
that's attached itself to your daughter.</b></font>

591
01:11:24,409 --> 01:11:26,869
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I need you to stay
at Ernesto's tonight, buddy.</b></font>

592
01:11:26,954 --> 01:11:28,664
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- But I wanna be here.
- I know.</b></font>

593
01:11:28,705 --> 01:11:30,865
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm not leaving, dad.</b></font>

594
01:11:33,752 --> 01:11:36,712
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Alex, we know you love her.</b></font>

595
01:11:37,381 --> 01:11:40,471
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But you do not wanna see the things
that tonight may show you.</b></font>

596
01:11:41,426 --> 01:11:42,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's gonna feel your love.</b></font>

597
01:11:45,597 --> 01:11:46,597
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Good night, buddy.</b></font>

598
01:11:51,895 --> 01:11:52,975
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Now what?</b></font>

599
01:12:01,071 --> 01:12:04,741
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This entity is very powerful.</b></font>

600
01:12:07,744 --> 01:12:10,914
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's a spirit who used to live
in this building a long time ago.</b></font>

601
01:12:10,998 --> 01:12:12,918
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's been alone for a long time.</b></font>

602
01:12:14,501 --> 01:12:16,091
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But she's making it stronger.</b></font>

603
01:12:16,670 --> 01:12:19,130
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's feeding on her life force.</b></font>

604
01:12:19,882 --> 01:12:21,262
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And wants to possess her?</b></font>

605
01:12:21,967 --> 01:12:25,967
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Usually, entities of this type,
living in the dark,</b></font>

606
01:12:26,054 --> 01:12:28,854
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>they want to possess the
bodies of the living</b></font>

607
01:12:28,932 --> 01:12:32,142
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>so that they can leave the dark
and return to life.</b></font>

608
01:12:35,063 --> 01:12:37,273
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But there's another kind of a spirit.</b></font>

609
01:12:42,571 --> 01:12:44,111
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's an even worse kind.</b></font>

610
01:12:45,782 --> 01:12:48,372
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>One that does not wanna leave the dark,</b></font>

611
01:12:48,952 --> 01:12:52,792
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>that wants the souls of the living
to join it in the shadows.</b></font>

612
01:12:54,625 --> 01:12:56,505
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's only half a person right now.</b></font>

613
01:12:56,919 --> 01:12:59,459
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>After the accident, it got half her soul.</b></font>

614
01:13:00,422 --> 01:13:01,802
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It needs all of it.</b></font>

615
01:13:02,549 --> 01:13:04,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And if we don't hurry,
it's going to get it.</b></font>

616
01:13:05,010 --> 01:13:07,010
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, what do we do now?</b></font>

617
01:13:07,095 --> 01:13:10,965
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>To bring all of your daughter back,
I'm going to have to go to where it lives.</b></font>

618
01:13:16,271 --> 01:13:18,271
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You can record everything,
even in the dark?</b></font>

619
01:13:18,315 --> 01:13:20,615
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah, of course. Whatever you need.</b></font>

620
01:13:20,651 --> 01:13:22,491
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm the technical part of the team.</b></font>

621
01:13:23,153 --> 01:13:24,823
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Then you better get set up.</b></font>

622
01:13:26,156 --> 01:13:27,236
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What's your contribution?</b></font>

623
01:13:28,700 --> 01:13:32,620
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Yeah, this should be good.
- It's not good, it's great. It's our blog.</b></font>

624
01:13:33,622 --> 01:13:34,662
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm the writer of it.</b></font>

625
01:13:35,916 --> 01:13:39,126
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, then, you write down
everything I describe when I'm under.</b></font>

626
01:13:42,172 --> 01:13:43,972
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>If you can keep up, that is.</b></font>

627
01:13:46,134 --> 01:13:49,724
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Now, I'm going into another plane.</b></font>

628
01:13:50,180 --> 01:13:53,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"Into another plane."</b></font>

629
01:13:54,685 --> 01:13:55,945
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Stay strong.</b></font>

630
01:13:57,187 --> 01:14:00,687
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No matter what happens,
no matter what you see.</b></font>

631
01:14:00,774 --> 01:14:02,984
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"No matter what..."</b></font>

632
01:14:03,026 --> 01:14:07,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Okay, could you just maybe write it down
and try not to talk?</b></font>

633
01:14:09,074 --> 01:14:10,284
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. Yeah.</b></font>

634
01:14:13,829 --> 01:14:17,119
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Sorry. Does this other plane have a name?</b></font>

635
01:14:20,252 --> 01:14:23,302
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Let's call it "the further."</b></font>

636
01:14:24,882 --> 01:14:28,012
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Cool name.
- Now, we're going to be quiet.</b></font>

637
01:14:34,183 --> 01:14:37,733
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Into the further, we go.</b></font>

638
01:14:42,149 --> 01:14:44,859
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm here. It's dark.</b></font>

639
01:14:47,905 --> 01:14:51,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I'm entering the hallway.</b></font>

640
01:15:00,375 --> 01:15:02,375
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You lived in this building, too?</b></font>

641
01:15:03,086 --> 01:15:06,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He made you kill yourself, didn't he?
Where is he?</b></font>

642
01:15:11,512 --> 01:15:12,602
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Show me.</b></font>

643
01:15:13,931 --> 01:15:15,851
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We're going upstairs.</b></font>

644
01:15:40,415 --> 01:15:42,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>His voice was always in my head.</b></font>

645
01:15:46,171 --> 01:15:47,631
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I was his pet.</b></font>

646
01:15:48,090 --> 01:15:50,180
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>He's got a new pet. The girl.</b></font>

647
01:15:51,051 --> 01:15:54,301
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Quinn is his new pet.
- There's no undoing.</b></font>

648
01:15:54,805 --> 01:15:57,435
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You can't even kill yourself
to get away from it.</b></font>

649
01:15:58,934 --> 01:16:01,394
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's okay. You're free now.</b></font>

650
01:16:09,570 --> 01:16:15,530
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I can hear it breathing.</b></font>

651
01:16:31,466 --> 01:16:32,506
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I hear it.</b></font>

652
01:16:52,613 --> 01:16:53,743
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Turn around.</b></font>

653
01:17:06,919 --> 01:17:09,799
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You're stronger than her. You're alive.</b></font>

654
01:17:11,507 --> 01:17:15,387
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- This is how you die.
- Not today, it isn't.</b></font>

655
01:17:26,980 --> 01:17:28,190
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come on, bitch.</b></font>

656
01:17:45,999 --> 01:17:47,169
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Let her go.</b></font>

657
01:17:47,709 --> 01:17:49,919
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Do you hear me? Release the girl!</b></font>

658
01:17:57,928 --> 01:17:58,928
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Jack?</b></font>

659
01:18:00,180 --> 01:18:01,310
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hi, Ellie.</b></font>

660
01:18:02,432 --> 01:18:03,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Come.</b></font>

661
01:18:04,476 --> 01:18:06,806
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Sit here with me.
- What are you doing here?</b></font>

662
01:18:07,938 --> 01:18:09,898
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Well, I could feel you were here.</b></font>

663
01:18:11,942 --> 01:18:15,702
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I had to find you.
- I've missed you so much.</b></font>

664
01:18:17,865 --> 01:18:20,625
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I know. I know.</b></font>

665
01:18:28,625 --> 01:18:31,585
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>How am I supposed to move on?</b></font>

666
01:18:32,880 --> 01:18:34,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I never even got to say goodbye.</b></font>

667
01:18:36,091 --> 01:18:37,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Well, maybe you can move on.</b></font>

668
01:18:38,802 --> 01:18:41,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I can't exist anywhere without you.</b></font>

669
01:18:43,891 --> 01:18:46,391
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>So, I wanted to ask you to join me here.</b></font>

670
01:18:47,269 --> 01:18:49,519
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You'd have to leave
your other world behind.</b></font>

671
01:18:51,023 --> 01:18:53,113
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Stop breathing in it, like I did.</b></font>

672
01:18:55,277 --> 01:18:56,737
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Stay with me here.</b></font>

673
01:18:59,114 --> 01:19:00,994
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You'll have to do it yourself.</b></font>

674
01:19:03,327 --> 01:19:04,617
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I can't help you.</b></font>

675
01:19:12,211 --> 01:19:13,961
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Don't you want to be with me?</b></font>

676
01:19:15,839 --> 01:19:16,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Want.</b></font>

677
01:19:18,550 --> 01:19:20,470
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>"Want" is not a strong enough word.</b></font>

678
01:19:23,847 --> 01:19:28,017
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I know my turn to cross over will come.</b></font>

679
01:19:30,020 --> 01:19:33,980
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>But I know that my Jack
would never ask me to do this.</b></font>

680
01:19:34,566 --> 01:19:35,566
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Demon.</b></font>

681
01:19:42,699 --> 01:19:45,199
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Give me the girl now
or I'll do a whole lot worse!</b></font>

682
01:20:01,051 --> 01:20:02,221
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Give her back.</b></font>

683
01:20:29,037 --> 01:20:33,077
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You may have half of her, but I am whole,</b></font>

684
01:20:33,834 --> 01:20:35,924
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and I am very strong.</b></font>

685
01:21:13,832 --> 01:21:15,002
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Go! Go, go!</b></font>

686
01:21:17,252 --> 01:21:19,052
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise, wake up! Elise!</b></font>

687
01:21:19,630 --> 01:21:20,710
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Elise!</b></font>

688
01:21:24,343 --> 01:21:26,013
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This way. This way.</b></font>

689
01:22:21,859 --> 01:22:23,069
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Quinn?
- Honey?</b></font>

690
01:22:23,193 --> 01:22:24,283
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Quinn!
- Honey, please.</b></font>

691
01:22:25,112 --> 01:22:27,112
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What's happening to her?
- It's got her.</b></font>

692
01:22:32,035 --> 01:22:35,035
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Wake up. don't let it take you.
Grab her hands!</b></font>

693
01:22:36,707 --> 01:22:40,707
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn, don't leave! don't leave!</b></font>

694
01:22:42,546 --> 01:22:43,586
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Stay with us!</b></font>

695
01:22:45,090 --> 01:22:48,300
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This world is your home! Not that one!
This one!</b></font>

696
01:22:56,185 --> 01:22:58,655
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What's happening? Is she dying?
- Just hold on to her.</b></font>

697
01:22:58,729 --> 01:23:00,229
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Is she?
- Yes.</b></font>

698
01:23:00,272 --> 01:23:04,282
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>No! No! Bring her back! Bring her back!
You said you could bring her back!</b></font>

699
01:23:04,359 --> 01:23:06,779
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- You need to help me. Quinn!
- What?</b></font>

700
01:23:06,862 --> 01:23:08,912
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Quinn, Quinn, hear us!
- Quinn.</b></font>

701
01:23:08,947 --> 01:23:10,527
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Come back to us!
- Quinn!</b></font>

702
01:23:16,747 --> 01:23:17,827
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What are you doing?</b></font>

703
01:23:18,248 --> 01:23:22,128
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>There's another woman here
who died in this building a few days ago.</b></font>

704
01:23:22,211 --> 01:23:24,341
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. Grace. Grace, the neighbor's wife.</b></font>

705
01:23:24,421 --> 01:23:27,801
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's saying something to me.
I can't hear it exactly.</b></font>

706
01:23:27,883 --> 01:23:29,303
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What is she saying?
- Honey, please!</b></font>

707
01:23:29,384 --> 01:23:32,014
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- What book? Grace, what book?
- Hurry!</b></font>

708
01:23:32,095 --> 01:23:33,425
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Hurry! Elise, hurry!</b></font>

709
01:23:35,599 --> 01:23:36,639
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Quinn's diary.</b></font>

710
01:23:39,186 --> 01:23:42,726
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is it. "Quinn, I wanted you to
find this on the day you graduated."</b></font>

711
01:23:42,856 --> 01:23:45,356
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>This is the letter that
Lily hid from Quinn.</b></font>

712
01:23:45,442 --> 01:23:48,112
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She wanted her to find it
on her graduation day.</b></font>

713
01:23:48,153 --> 01:23:52,033
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She tried to get her to read it early.
She was trying to reach Quinn.</b></font>

714
01:23:52,115 --> 01:23:55,235
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Quinn!
- Lily, I know you were trying to reach her.</b></font>

715
01:23:55,285 --> 01:23:57,945
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>We know that you wanted her
to read this letter.</b></font>

716
01:23:58,247 --> 01:24:00,247
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Lily, we need you now!</b></font>

717
01:24:01,792 --> 01:24:02,792
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Help us.</b></font>

718
01:25:02,811 --> 01:25:03,851
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Dad.</b></font>

719
01:25:12,070 --> 01:25:14,820
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Thank you.
- We had some help.</b></font>

720
01:25:17,159 --> 01:25:18,159
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Who?</b></font>

721
01:25:19,411 --> 01:25:21,161
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Someone else is here with us.</b></font>

722
01:25:25,167 --> 01:25:27,957
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Someone who really wants to talk to you.</b></font>

723
01:25:30,130 --> 01:25:31,130
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Mom.</b></font>

724
01:25:37,387 --> 01:25:42,387
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I need to know that this is real.
- Okay.</b></font>

725
01:25:47,105 --> 01:25:51,065
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's saying something
about a stage, an audition.</b></font>

726
01:25:52,027 --> 01:25:55,697
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She says that when you were on stage,
you wanted to know if she was there.</b></font>

727
01:25:58,909 --> 01:26:00,239
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She was there.</b></font>

728
01:26:04,498 --> 01:26:06,828
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And she was so proud of you.</b></font>

729
01:26:12,798 --> 01:26:15,178
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She wants you, and you, Sean,</b></font>

730
01:26:15,259 --> 01:26:17,929
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>to know that you don't need
to look for her anymore.</b></font>

731
01:26:20,097 --> 01:26:23,427
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Because she'll always be with you.
No matter what.</b></font>

732
01:26:24,810 --> 01:26:27,350
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's gonna be standing right beside you.</b></font>

733
01:26:27,437 --> 01:26:29,647
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And even though you can't see her,
she's there.</b></font>

734
01:26:31,024 --> 01:26:36,864
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>And anytime you're feeling
confused or alone,</b></font>

735
01:26:38,156 --> 01:26:40,366
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>she's gonna be whispering in your ear.</b></font>

736
01:26:45,998 --> 01:26:48,998
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>She's never coming back again, is she?</b></font>

737
01:26:51,587 --> 01:26:53,047
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Not to this world.</b></font>

738
01:27:10,898 --> 01:27:11,898
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I love you.</b></font>

739
01:27:16,653 --> 01:27:17,953
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Good job, boys.</b></font>

740
01:27:47,184 --> 01:27:48,314
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Careful.</b></font>

741
01:27:52,189 --> 01:27:53,269
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thanks.</b></font>

742
01:27:58,028 --> 01:28:00,278
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Is that the first time you've seen a Ghost?</b></font>

743
01:28:00,364 --> 01:28:01,914
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Well...
- Yes.</b></font>

744
01:28:02,658 --> 01:28:04,278
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>You never get used to it.</b></font>

745
01:28:05,702 --> 01:28:08,622
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Spectral sightings, I like that.</b></font>

746
01:28:08,705 --> 01:28:11,035
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- That one's mine.
- Is it?</b></font>

747
01:28:11,083 --> 01:28:13,923
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Stop. You boys fight too much.</b></font>

748
01:28:14,002 --> 01:28:16,962
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>It's unnecessary.
It's clear you both need each other.</b></font>

749
01:28:19,925 --> 01:28:21,895
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Maybe we should go into business together?</b></font>

750
01:28:23,595 --> 01:28:26,305
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I thought you said this business
was too dangerous for you</b></font>

751
01:28:26,390 --> 01:28:28,480
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>and you said it could kill you.</b></font>

752
01:28:28,559 --> 01:28:33,019
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yeah. Well, everybody's gonna die one day.</b></font>

753
01:28:34,606 --> 01:28:39,646
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I think it is high time for me to get
out of my house while I'm still alive.</b></font>

754
01:28:41,321 --> 01:28:42,411
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What do you think?</b></font>

755
01:28:43,699 --> 01:28:44,909
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Yes?</b></font>

756
01:28:44,950 --> 01:28:46,280
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- Yeah.
- Sure.</b></font>

757
01:28:46,368 --> 01:28:48,578
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Well then, take me to my car.</b></font>

758
01:28:51,456 --> 01:28:52,456
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>That's great.</b></font>

759
01:28:52,541 --> 01:28:56,751
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I also think that you guys should think
about wearing something a little better,</b></font>

760
01:28:56,795 --> 01:28:58,835
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>if we're gonna be working together.</b></font>

761
01:28:58,922 --> 01:29:02,472
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- I'll have you know this tee is extremely rare.
- Well, I'm sure it is.</b></font>

762
01:29:02,551 --> 01:29:05,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>- So, you should apologize.
- I apologize.</b></font>

763
01:29:05,679 --> 01:29:08,469
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>What would you have us wear instead?</b></font>

764
01:29:09,558 --> 01:29:11,598
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Shirt and tie might be nice.</b></font>

765
01:29:13,145 --> 01:29:14,315
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Ain't gonna happen.</b></font>

766
01:29:18,525 --> 01:29:21,145
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Warren, you old dog.</b></font>

767
01:29:22,070 --> 01:29:23,910
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Thank you for looking after me.</b></font>

768
01:29:34,124 --> 01:29:35,294
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>Where is the...</b></font>

769
01:29:50,807 --> 01:29:52,387
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#ffff80"><b>I love you too, Jack.</b></font>

